#
# The block spelling over every resource's `Cfg`, handed on whole by `[*]`: over `R1.Cfg`, a map whose
# own key `Limits` names a member and no member holds a `Limits` of its own (`Other` among them), the
# block is refused for that one value and the other two resources' maps are evaluated and reported
# beside it.
#
rule r { Resources.*.Cfg[*] { Limits exists  Tier == 'gold' } }
